    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you... Thank you so much...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not safe here. You should hurry and leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where... would we go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was a place we could call home... But it's all ruined now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not your fault...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that... is what I call bad publicity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island does not give empty promises.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are few who can see through the illusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nnh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful! You can't move around yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a bit dizzy... Don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Reunion... still chasing us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what they want from me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's leave right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shortly, we'll be able to exit the slums and meet up with the L.G.D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Misha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... should be thanking you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
